---
// The paper-coloured block the archive rows sit in, so every index page reads
// the same way: blue heading block at the top, rows on paper below it, and a
// photograph at the foot. The photo sequences index has always looked like
// this — IndexTable is the same idea with a column header attached — and the
// publication indexes were brought into line in August 2026.
//
// Rows inside must be told to switch to their ink-on-paper colours: pass
// tone="paper" to PublicationRow or BookRow.
---

<div class="archive-block">
  <slot />
</div>

<style>
  .archive-block {
    background: var(--cream);
    padding: 26px var(--page-pad) 30px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .archive-block {
      padding: 20px 20px 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
